        "status": "inspected",
        "rendition": "exact-published-native-original",
        "notes": "Personally inspected exact427x302/40823byte already-published USAF aerial, and independently matched the lower photograph on printed72/PDF90 of the original1989 official volume. Title1/catalog2/author7/chapter89/photos90/technical text92 inspected. The photograph covers the parade-ground area and one large hangar, not every base building or roof. Low light-industrial buildings, pitched roofs and the major hangar inform enduring architectural vocabulary. Native actual current footprints independently govern all84 surviving campus buildings; unphotographed roof sections/heights/openings/colors and control tower form are explicitly original medium-fi estimates. No1924/1942upper photograph, contractor molehole photos, aircraft/badges, trees/parade grass/runway/site slab or image textures adopted."
