    "notes": "Qualla-first16families/zero conflicts. Sole selected already-published1982USAF aerial has exact native USAF employee credit and PD-USGov-Military-Air Force grant; corresponding photo independently inspected in original1989Office of Air Force History Reference Series volume. Narrow original-volume guard binds native file/artist/date/source/grant and exact retained PDF/inspected caption/page; no blanket government-host or contractor-work assumption. Local omitted basis is supplemented in model proof without modifying Qualla metadata. All84 whole building rings and current control-tower point recovered in enlarged19317-element native map, every-status Q472049/Q1962553/building-ID/name alias reserved match zero. Three landuse/aerodrome perimeters select the built campus but are not walls. Native geometry is current; all height/roof profiles/hidden openings/material colors/tower cab are original bounded estimates. No contractor or attribution-only source used."
